ceulen-dsh
==========

This project ports parts of Ceulen (https://github.com/ceulen-dev/ceulen,
npm package `ceulen`, MIT licensed, Copyright (c) ceulen-dev/ceulen
contributors) to the DeepSeek Harness plugin API.

Ported files are kept under `src/vendor/ceulen/` and retain their upstream
headers. Upstream version and per-file hashes are recorded in
`upstream.lock.json`; `scripts/ceulen-sync.mjs` uses those hashes to upgrade
unmodified vendored files and to report locally modified ones.

Ceulen is a Pi coding-agent bundle. DeepSeek Harness is a different runtime;
this project is an independent adaptation, not an official Ceulen release.
